#. placeholder {0}: persona.name
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete <0>{0}</0>? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Voulez-vous vraiment supprimer <0>{0}</0> ? Cette action est irréversible."

msgid "Are you sure you want to replace all <0>{existingCount}</0> existing persona(s)? This will permanently delete them from your account and cannot be undone."
msgstr "Voulez-vous vraiment remplacer l'ensemble des <0>{existingCount}</0> persona(s) existante(s) ? Elles seront définitivement supprimées de votre compte et cette action est irréversible."

#. Generic action label that opens the persona picker.
msgid "Change persona"
msgstr "Changer de persona"

msgid "Delete Persona"
msgstr "Supprimer la persona"

msgid "Edit persona"
msgstr "Modifier la persona"

msgid "Main account"
msgstr "Compte principal"

#. OAuth scope description shown on the consent screen for the personas.write scope.
msgid "Manage and create your personas"
msgstr "Gérez et créez vos personas"

#. User settings tab for personas.
msgid "Personas"
msgstr "Personas"

msgid "Replace All"
msgstr "Tout remplacer"

msgid "Replace All Personas"
msgstr "Remplacer toutes les personas"

#. Plus menu submenu toggle that shows the persona selector next to the textarea.
#. Short label for an advanced message input preference.
msgid "Show personas button"
msgstr "Afficher le bouton des personas"

#. OAuth scope description shown on the consent screen for the personas.read scope.
msgid "View your personas"
msgstr "Voir vos personas"
